<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>For Warzone 2
This is not a visual trick, this script allows you to instantly fix a bug, it may be fixed soon, but currently it works.
You can assign a macro to a button that has the command to lay down, it's the most convenient use.</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>RightDown 1
Delay 105 ms
RightUp 1
Delay 45 ms
KeyDown 224 1
Delay 46 ms
KeyUp 224 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Call of Duty: War Zone</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>